{"title":"2004 IMO Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a convex quadrilateral <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />, the diagonal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89fff82bb65d0215e49c8c91cb7c553da52205e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> bisects neither the angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />\nnor the angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/c/17ccf9ac51faa912a5338f4ebde95b5d3a0f7fb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CDA$\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />. The point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lies inside <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> and satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/7/977f696cf8654292a2d57df388ce9a1baff926af.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\angle PBC = \\angle DBA \\text{ and } \\angle PDC = \\angle BDA.\\]\" width=\"315\" height=\"13\" /> \n</p><p>Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is a cyclic quadrilateral if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/5/d854fcbb426e0d95c5e3b03c2ff72cffcd2bd61a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP = CP.$\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is cyclic,\nlet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" />  be the intersection of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7baf95ecafc2d7791788ec79aeeae390d60b119.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> be the intersection of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/3/c7387ef3aa3162cea3e516216d4ed946506bd30d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/9/7a9e4cb7af8185756314b4ab4f15b6252995180b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(6cm); draw(circle((0,0),7.07)); draw((-3.7,-6)-- (3.7,-6)); draw((-6.8,-2)-- (6.8,-2)); draw((-5,5)-- (5,5)); draw((-5,5)-- (-3.7,-6)); draw((-5,5)-- (3.7,-6)); draw((-5,5)-- (-6.8,-2)); draw((-5,5)-- (6.8,-2)); draw((5,5)-- (-3.7,-6)); draw((5,5)-- (3.7,-6)); draw((5,5)-- (-6.8,-2)); draw((5,5)-- (6.8,-2)); draw((-3.7,-6)-- (-6.8,-2)); draw((-3.7,-6)-- (6.8,-2)); draw((3.7,-6)-- (-6.8,-2)); draw((3.7,-6)-- (6.8,-2)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, (-6.8,-2), SW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, (-3.7,-6), SW); label(&quot;$F$&quot;, (3.7,-6), SE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, (6.8,-2), E); label(&quot;$E$&quot;, (5,5), E); label(&quot;$D$&quot;, (-5,5), W); label(&quot;$P$&quot;, (0,-1.3), N); label(&quot;$K$&quot;, (-1.6,-1.5), E); label(&quot;$L$&quot;, (0.8,-1.5) );                         [/asy]\" width=\"285\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/e/86e7e474f5ab2f19ded72550661e0d18b6c241fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle PBC=\\angle DBA$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"139\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/d/2fd28369db7ca522f216022f9970a8bfc1dcbeae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD=CE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/3/bd356d3075952ca36875e8eafbeacf8d760eba0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE//AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"20\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/c/04cbdaf21d6117a4604fdf5d2051e57f3b4a7ee5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle PDC=\\angle BDA$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"140\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/7/437345c5f0f85dd2b2d26cb3e3c311dc2a6812ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=CF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"83\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/6/c563ff20268991772f74f27050f4b427d8baac01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC//BF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"76\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n<pre><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/1/a51bb82ba61ac0f0b59ccafcef2fe557ec1644bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle PLK=\\frac12(\\overarc{AD}+\\overarc{CF})=\\frac12(\\overarc{CE}+\\overarc{AB})=\\angle PKL$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"381\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/b/c8b2f7689f3b57bcd1410dbec44d00d04e100b1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle PKL$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is an isosceles triangle.\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/6/c563ff20268991772f74f27050f4b427d8baac01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC//BF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"76\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/1/161920421d2ac444fe043bb9c3e3e6652046cc70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle PBF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/a/85a66de014aae7c9892d12234872ccc7c10c9638.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle PDE$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> are isosceles triangles. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is on the perpendicular bisector of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/e/65e4f2d5cc59e5ffbed3734130e8c45b643adc91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/a/37afb92ef984a0a414a2c7d747a73bfd62ac8e3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABFC$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> is \nan isosceles trapezoid, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is also on the perpendicular bisector of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/f/f6f7eaef42f59f2477d8b22d43f36f3026a5bc25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PA=PC$\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" />.\n</pre>\n<p><br />\n</p><p>~szhangmath\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO\" title=\"2004 IMO\">2004 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems\" title=\"2004 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2004 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2004 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2004 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017092812\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 205/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 894/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6721/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.732      1 Template:IMO_box\n100.00%    6.732      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:19564:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017092812 and revision id 231457. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}